flowchart LR
  claim[Claim due endpoints<br/>Token and lease]
  request[Validate, pin, and GET<br/>Bounded deadline]
  owner[Lock row and fence lease<br/>Transaction begins]
  skip[Skip stale scheduled result<br/>No observation inserted]
  save[Save check and lifecycle<br/>Latest-result incident policy]
  commit[Release owned claim and commit<br/>Readers see saved history]

  claim --> request -->|HTTP outcome| owner
  owner -->|Lost lease| skip
  owner -->|Valid lease| save --> commit

